'''Mythic Cats''' (レジェンドにゃんこ ''Rejendo Nyanko'', '''Legend Cats''') are a type of [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Main Chapters Levels|Main Chapters]], main [[Legend Stages]], and [[Heavenly Tower]]. Mythic Cats differentiate from other Special Cats in their general attributes, which are more in line with [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] or [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rare Cats]], with higher stats, costs and recharge times. This makes them among the strongest non-[[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha]] units in the game, at least in terms of stats. However, their overall level cap is more restrictive than most other units.

Except for [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], all Mythic Cats are unlocked by clearing a stage that features their [[:Category:Mythic Bosses|enemy counterpart]].

