==Previews==
When entering an area with Mythic Cats, the player will get to see a preview of the next one they can unlock, usually in the form of a silhouette. As of [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], Mythic Cat previews shown when entering [[Legend Stages]] include the number of sub-chapters left to be cleared until you reach them, or "(Challenge Now!)" if their sub-chapter has been reached.

